kiln::semantic

  × mkinitcpio cannot build an initramfs that boots an OSTree system
   ╭─[system.toml:8:13]
 7 │ [boot]
 8 │ initramfs = "mkinitcpio"
   ·             ──────┬─────
   ·                   ╰── not available
   ╰────
  help: the sysroot pivot needs an initramfs hook, and upstream ostree
        ships one for dracut (`50ostree`, in the `ostree` package) and
        none for mkinitcpio. Writing and maintaining a boot-critical
        hook is not something Kiln does; remove this                              line
        to get dracut.
